<!doctype html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #111827; padding: 28px 28px 24px; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px">
      <span style="display: inline-block; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 6px; background: oklch(0.55 0.14 180); color: #fff; text-align: center; line-height: 24px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700">S</span>
      <span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #171717">{{.InstanceName}}</span>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 14px">Your password was changed</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #171717; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 14px">Hi {{.EmailLocalPart}},</p>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #171717; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 14px">
      The password on your {{.InstanceName}} account was just changed. Every device signed into this account was signed out, and every OAuth token issued before this moment has been invalidated.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #525252; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 14px">
      <strong>Didn't change your password?</strong> Someone may have gained access to your account. Contact your administrator immediately.
    </p>

    <div style="padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-size: 12px; color: #737373; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 24px">
      Sent by {{.InstanceName}}. You're receiving this because the password on your account was changed.
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
